{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1644969600, "end_date": 1645660799, "month_true_total": 199, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:03:57 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "110849269", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961203231", "personaname": "Arterrduan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961203231/", "num_games_owned": 3269, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 1599, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1579, "last_played": 1672866549, "avatar": "77828b96de5bd1cdf281455ce964bb191336b9a8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] 确实是求生之路的精神续作 [/h1]\n[b] 可以说是目前市场上最接近求生之路的游戏了 [/b]\n还不错，沉迷了几天，喜欢求生之路系列的很适合玩这款，可以看做是求生之路3，僵尸很智能，有一定的挑战难度。\n虽然我预购的是终极版，但不建议购买终极版，价格过高，多的只是几个角色皮肤，也不是特别好看，没啥实际意义。\n所谓的年票，至今还没有出新内容，感觉就是画饼，你倒是多更点新内容啊，难度从幸存者打到了老兵再打到噩梦，几个章节几张图反复打，都打完了，很快就腻了。\n难度设置也不是很合理，我只想通过新手难度熟悉了游戏以后，然后打具有一定难度、有挑战性的，而幸存者难度太简单，老兵难度太一般没啥挑战性，噩梦难度又太难了，简直变态。要么太简单要么太难，真是两个极端。", "timestamp_created": 1645650906, "timestamp_updated": 1645650906, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507964909076690674", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "110839428", "author": {"steamid": "76561198404775739", "personaname": "极氪9X你", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198404775739/", "num_games_owned": 86, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2581, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1864, "last_played": 1648056808, "avatar": "b2c0f6ee35e24dd0c577dfc3d873ea005e0da8c2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "友情提示，如果和不认识的路人一起玩，还不如带三个电脑冲，阳间多多了。、\n游戏本身很赞枪械模型射击手感都一流，人物技能卡牌腐败卡的加入让这个游戏比L4D2有了更多的随机性和乐趣。\n但目前还没有mode希望日后官方能加入，就是关卡难度有点难，真的。\n最后希望你那个b配件能不能改成能拆卸的啊，真的日总是把那些金红配件放在一些阴间武器上，必须得遇到相同位置的配件才能拆下来，真的脑                     瘫！！！！！！！！！！！！", "timestamp_created": 1645639302, "timestamp_updated": 1645639302, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 17, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.674524366855621338", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "110832091", "author": {"steamid": "76561199216080949", "personaname": "鸟不飞海", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199216080949/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 945, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 383, "last_played": 1759999351, "avatar": "bc8304a57dd2892d90d34674eb284587549c4524"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "匹配到的都是垃圾队友", "timestamp_created": 1645630449, "timestamp_updated": 1645630449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541586101055145264", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "110809729", "author": {"steamid": "76561198892041048", "personaname": "Poem", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198892041048/", "num_games_owned": 168, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 653, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 548, "last_played": 1784218126, "avatar": "2ec29c8674b914788e97fac21543ae73fcc0d938"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好！", "timestamp_created": 1645594073, "timestamp_updated": 1645594073, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "receiv